description:
This is a combined synopsis/solicitation for commercial items prepared in accordance with the format in FAR Part 12.&nbsp; This announcement constitutes the only solicitation.&nbsp; Quotations are being requested and separate written solicitation will not be issued.&nbsp; 

Solicitation number 124PSA27Q0004 is issued as a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for Municipal Solid Waste and Recyclable Materials Collection Services &nbsp; 

This acquisition&nbsp; is set-aside for small business concerns.&nbsp; The applicable North American Industry Classification Standard Code is 562111&nbsp; The small business size standard is $47M. &nbsp;This acquisition is a Total Small Business Set-Aside.&nbsp; All responsible sources may submit a quotation which will be considered by the agency.&nbsp;
